# --- Accidental nested clone (do not delete, do not commit) ---
# `Emergency revenue recovery milestone/` is a second, stale clone of THIS
# repository that ended up nested inside the working copy. Verified on
# 2026-09-10: its HEAD (11bf4e0, "Milestone 7 - CRM Integrations complete")
# is an ancestor of main, its working tree is clean, and every commit it
# holds is already in this repository's history — so it contains no unique
# work and nothing is lost by ignoring it.
#
# It is ignored rather than deleted because deleting ~773MB of someone's
# working copy is not a decision a tooling change should make silently.
# Ignoring it is what stops `git add -A` from staging it as a gitlink, which
# would produce a commit referencing a submodule that does not exist for
# anyone else who clones this repo.
/Emergency revenue recovery milestone/
